#: 136f9ab404ec4b8e8db518632c7948e8
msgid "To achieve centimeter-level precision in positioning, RTK correction data must be sent to your drone in real time. There are two main methods for delivering this correction data:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ardusimple-rtk-gps-simplertk3b-pro.rst:64
#: 5781f5b9fa2a4460836799477bdf2daf
msgid "Using NTRIP correction service:  If you are going to operate in areas with reliable internet connection and NTRIP service coverage, follow `Tutorial on sending NTRIP corrections to ArduPilot. <https://www.ardusimple.com/send-ntrip-corrections-to-ardupilot-with-missionplanner-qgroundcontrol-and-mavproxy/>`_  If you are not aware of NTRIP service provider in your area, we have prepared the `List of RTK correction service providers in your country. <https://www.ardusimple.com/rtk-correction-services-in-your-country/>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ardusimple-rtk-gps-simplertk3b-pro.rst:65
#: 806cb9726c404122a74678ac1fbf2f95
msgid "Using RTK corrections from a Base Station: if there is no internet access or NTRIP correction service available in your area, refer to ArduSimple’s `tutorial on sending RTK corrections from Base station to ArduPilot. <https://www.ardusimple.com/send-rtk-base-station-corrections-to-ardupilot-with-missionplanner-qgroundcontrol-and-mavproxy/>`_"
msgstr ""

